Usage: homi status [<args>]

Report whether a server is holding devices. Asks the server over its socket and opens no device, so it disturbs no I/O. Exits non-zero until a server is up and its devices are ready.
  
Where <args> include:

  --homi-id NUM                 ; The HOMI identifier to share controllers under
  [ --help ]                    ; Show usage / help

See 'homi --help' for other commands

homi - Host-Orchestrated Multi-path I/O -- ver: {major: 0, minor: 7, patch: 5}
